  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;be a real number. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math> be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math> be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>35</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>53</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mi>&#947;</mi></mfrac></math> are the roots of the equation :",
    "image": null
  },
